{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/core-contributions/prospect-theory/prospect-theory","wordCount":2097,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"前景理论\">前景理论</h1><p>1979 年 3 月，丹尼尔·卡尼曼与阿莫斯·特沃斯基在《计量经济学》（Econometrica）第 47 卷第 2 期第 263–291 页发表《前景理论：风险下的决策分析》（Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk）。这是该刊有史以来被引用最多的论文。它不是又一个偏误，而是一个<strong>完整的替代理论</strong>：用一组可写成方程、可拟合数据、可预测反常的描述性模型，取代统治了三十年的期望效用理论。卡尼曼 2002 年的诺贝尔经济学奖，核心正是这篇论文。本篇讲前景理论的整体结构——参照点、价值函数、概率权重、四重模式；其中&quot;损失厌恶&quot;这一最著名分支由姊妹篇 <a href=\"loss-aversion\">损失厌恶</a> 单独深展，本篇只给出它在方程中的位置。理论的认知机制底座见 <a href=\"../two-systems/system-1-and-system-2\">系统1与系统2</a>，对经济学的下游冲击见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/birth-of-behavioral-economics/\">影响与遗产·行为经济学的诞生</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.jstor.org/stable/1914185\">Econometrica 47(2):263–291</a>；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prospect_theory\">Prospect theory（Wikipedia 综述）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>参照点（reference point）</strong>：评价的零点；价值定义在相对参照点的得失上，而非绝对财富。</li>\n<li><strong>价值函数 v(x)</strong>：收益区凹、损失区凸、损失区更陡（损失厌恶 λ≈2.25）的 S 形曲线。</li>\n<li><strong>概率权重 w(p)</strong>：非线性决策权重，系统高估小概率、低估中高概率，呈反 S 形。</li>\n<li><strong>四重模式</strong>：价值函数与权重函数相乘的预测，解释为何同一人既买彩票又买保险。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"它要取代什么-期望效用理论\">它要取代什么：期望效用理论</h2><p>1979 年的正统是冯·诺依曼-摩根斯坦的<strong>期望效用理论</strong>（EU）：理性人对每个结果赋予效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按概率加权求和，选期望效用最大的方案：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EU = \\sum_i p_i \\, u(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>EU 的关键假设有三：(1) 人评价<strong>最终财富状态</strong>的绝对效用；(2) 概率被<strong>线性</strong>使用（概率 0.01 与 0.02 的权重差，等于 0.50 与 0.51 的差）；(3) 偏好满足一致性公理（如独立性公理）。卡尼曼与特沃斯基用一系列配对赌局实验，逐条证伪了这三点。前景理论的每个组件，都对应一个被推翻的 EU 假设。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>EU 假设</th>\n<th>实验反例</th>\n<th>前景理论的替代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评价绝对财富</td>\n<td>同一终态因&quot;涨/跌到此&quot;而感受不同</td>\n<td>参照点 + 得失编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率线性</td>\n<td>确定性效应、可能性效应</td>\n<td>概率权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险态度单一</td>\n<td>收益区避险、损失区追险</td>\n<td>S 形价值函数 + 四重模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏好一致</td>\n<td>框架反转选择（见 <a href=\"../heuristics-and-biases/cognitive-biases\">认知偏误</a>）</td>\n<td>编辑阶段对结果重新表征</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价值函数-参照点-得失不对称-敏感度递减\">价值函数：参照点、得失不对称、敏感度递减</h2><p>前景理论的核心是把&quot;效用&quot;换成&quot;价值&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>相对于参照点的偏离</strong>而非绝对财富。价值函数有三条经验定律，可写成 1992 年累积前景理论给出的典型参数化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>β</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\nx^{\\alpha}, &amp; x \\ge 0 \\\\[4pt]\n-\\lambda\\,(-x)^{\\beta}, &amp; x &lt; 0\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad \\alpha=\\beta\\approx 0.88,\\; \\lambda\\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.28em;vertical-align:-1.39em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.89em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.39em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三条定律：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>参照依赖</strong>：价值定义在得失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 相对参照点）上，不在终态上。这解释了为何同样的 100 万终态，&quot;从 200 万跌下来&quot;是巨痛、&quot;从 50 万涨上去&quot;是大喜。</li>\n<li><strong>敏感度递减</strong>：函数在收益区凹（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）、损失区凸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）——第一个 100 元的得失比第一千个 100 元的得失感受强烈。</li>\n<li><strong>损失厌恶</strong>：损失区比收益区<strong>更陡</strong>，斜率比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>，即同等数额的损失痛约为收益乐的两倍多（实证估计多落在 1.5–2.5，2.0 为教科书惯用值）。这条定律由 <a href=\"loss-aversion\">损失厌恶</a> 专篇展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;价值函数 v&quot;x&quot;&quot;&#10;    L[&quot;损失区:凸 + 陡&lt;br/&gt;斜率 ×2.25&quot;] --- O[&quot;参照点 0&lt;br/&gt;(折点在此)&quot;] --- G[&quot;收益区:凹 + 缓&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    O --&gt; NOTE[&quot;关键:折点而非原点&lt;br/&gt;损失一侧斜率突然变陡&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph \"价值函数 v\"x\"\"\n    L[\"损失区:凸 + 陡&lt;br/&gt;斜率 ×2.25\"] --- O[\"参照点 0&lt;br/&gt;(折点在此)\"] --- G[\"收益区:凹 + 缓\"]\n    end\n    O --&gt; NOTE[\"关键:折点而非原点&lt;br/&gt;损失一侧斜率突然变陡\"]</pre><h2 id=\"概率权重函数-确定性效应与可能性效应\">概率权重函数：确定性效应与可能性效应</h2><p>EU 假设概率被原样使用；前景理论代之以一个非线性的<strong>决策权重</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它系统地高估小概率、低估中高概率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = w(p), \\qquad w(p)=\\frac{p^{\\gamma}}{\\left(p^{\\gamma}+(1-p)^{\\gamma}\\right)^{1/\\gamma}},\\quad \\gamma\\approx 0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5093em;vertical-align:-1.1679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7049em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1679em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个判决性现象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确定性效应</strong>（Allais 悖论）：从 100% 降到 99% 的主观分量，远大于从 60% 降到 59%。人愿为&quot;消除最后那点不确定&quot;付出不成比例的代价——这驱动了保险与赎金行为。</li>\n<li><strong>可能性效应</strong>：从 0% 升到 1% 的主观分量，也远大于从 10% 升到 11%。&quot;哪怕一线希望&quot;被放大——这驱动了买彩票、对罕见巨灾的过度反应。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二者合起来就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的反 S 形：两端（0 与 1 附近）陡、中段平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四重风险态度模式\">四重风险态度模式</h2><p>价值函数（得失不对称）与权重函数（小概率高估）相乘，得出前景理论最强的预测——<strong>四重模式</strong>（fourfold pattern），它一举解释了为何同一个人既买彩票又买保险：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>收益</th>\n<th>损失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>高概率</strong></td>\n<td>避险（宁要确定的小收益）→ 接受不利和解</td>\n<td>追险（赌一把躲开确定损失）→ 拒绝合理和解、上诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>低概率</strong></td>\n<td>追险（买彩票）→ 接受不利赌局</td>\n<td>避险（买保险）→ 接受不利保费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张 2×2 表是前景理论凌驾 EU 的最有力证据：EU 用单一的风险态度无法同时容纳&quot;买彩票&quot;（爱风险）和&quot;买保险&quot;（恶风险），而四重模式精确预测了在哪个象限出现哪种态度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何重要-权衡-反模式与原创综合\">为何重要：权衡、反模式与原创综合</h2><p><strong>为何是&quot;描述性&quot;而非&quot;规范性&quot;理论</strong>。这是理解前景理论的关键权衡，也是常见反模式所在。EU 是规范理论——告诉理性人<strong>应当</strong>怎么选；前景理论是描述理论——刻画人<strong>实际</strong>怎么选。卡尼曼从不主张人应该损失厌恶或高估小概率；他主张的是，若要预测真实市场、真实谈判、真实投保行为，必须用前景理论而非 EU。<strong>误把前景理论当成&quot;更好的理性准则&quot;是头号误读</strong>：损失厌恶让人持有亏损股太久，这是该被纠正的偏差，不是该被效法的智慧。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式二：把价值函数当成全部</strong>。许多通俗介绍只讲&quot;损失痛是收益乐的两倍&quot;，漏掉概率权重与四重模式，于是无法解释买彩票（小概率收益却追险）。完整的前景理论是价值函数 × 权重函数的<strong>乘积</strong>，缺一不可——这正是本篇坚持把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并列展开的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>1979 vs 1992 的版本差异</strong>。原始前景理论（1979）有个技术缺陷：在多结果赌局中可能违反随机占优。1992 年两人发表&quot;累积前景理论&quot;（CPT），改用秩依赖（rank-dependent）方式对累积概率加权，修复了这一缺陷，上文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\approx2.25,\\ \\gamma\\approx0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span> 即出自该版的实证拟合。这一修订史本身是科学诚实的样本，详见 <a href=\"../../major-works/research-legacy/\">代表成就·研究的成就</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>原创综合：一个理论统摄全部偏误</strong>。回看 <a href=\"../heuristics-and-biases/cognitive-biases\">认知偏误</a> 里的框架效应、<a href=\"loss-aversion\">损失厌恶</a> 里的禀赋效应与现状偏好——它们不是各自独立的怪癖，而是<strong>同一组方程（参照依赖 + 损失厌恶 + 非线性权重）在不同情境下的投影</strong>。框架效应是参照点被措辞移动；禀赋效应是放弃即损失、获得即收益的不对称；保险与彩票并存是权重函数两端高估。前景理论之所以拿下诺奖，不在于发现某个新偏误，而在于用一个紧凑的数学结构，把一堆散落的反常<strong>收编成可预测的系统</strong>——这是从&quot;列偏误&quot;到&quot;建理论&quot;的质变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>前景理论用参照点、S 形价值函数、非线性概率权重三件套，逐条替换了期望效用的三个假设。</li>\n<li>四重模式（高/低概率 × 收益/损失）是其凌驾期望效用的最强证据，一举容纳买彩票与买保险。</li>\n<li>它是描述性而非规范性理论：刻画人实际怎么选，不主张人应当损失厌恶——误读为&quot;理性准则&quot;是头号陷阱。</li>\n<li>1992 年累积前景理论修复了随机占优缺陷，给出 λ≈2.25、γ≈0.61 的实证参数；损失厌恶单独展开见 <a href=\"loss-aversion\">损失厌恶</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前景理论","id":"前景理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"它要取代什么：期望效用理论","id":"它要取代什么-期望效用理论"},{"level":2,"text":"价值函数：参照点、得失不对称、敏感度递减","id":"价值函数-参照点-得失不对称-敏感度递减"},{"level":2,"text":"概率权重函数：确定性效应与可能性效应","id":"概率权重函数-确定性效应与可能性效应"},{"level":2,"text":"四重风险态度模式","id":"四重风险态度模式"},{"level":2,"text":"为何重要：权衡、反模式与原创综合","id":"为何重要-权衡-反模式与原创综合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"认知偏误","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/core-contributions/heuristics-and-biases/cognitive-biases"},"next":{"title":"损失厌恶","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/core-contributions/prospect-theory/loss-aversion"}}